News - Matching production requirements for small order of glass bottles
Matching production requirements for small order of glass bottles News
Many customers because of the market development in the early stage of the glass bottle needs issue orders is not very big, so it will is the glass bottle factory production to meet stringent requirements, especially the assembly line production process, many factories to solve the problem is the collocation glass bottle weight production, according to how similar bottle type, thus to meet the needs of our customers.
First of all, it is to see whether the weight of several matching glass bottles is close. The weight difference of glass bottles can not exceed 3-5 grams, so that the glass bottle capacity will not have a big impact.
See if several bottles with the same weight are close to the bottle type, the difference of the bottle type will affect the shape adjustment of the feed drop, the speed of the machine, the adjustment of the initial mold and the mold nozzle and the blowing pressure, etc., the bottle type gap is too large, the bottom and finish of the glass bottle produced will also change.
Glass bottle mouth must be consistent, wide bottle and wide bottle collocation, small bottle and small bottle together, which is conducive to glass drop shape adjustment, otherwise it will affect the material drop into the initial mold speed, consumption of hours.
The quantity of several counterweight glass bottles should be the same, and the production should be changed at the same time, and the production line should be rolled out at the same time.
When these glass bottles are produced together, the production speed of the glass bottle production line will be slightly reduced, and the output will not be the same as the normal production process, but many glass bottle factories will take these costs into account to meet the needs of these different customers. Post time: Dec-02-2021
