The rubber beltshot blasting machineis suitable for cleaning small and medium-sized castings that are not afraid of collision, because its structure is mainly a rubber crawler that can run forward and backward, cooperate with one disc on the left and right to form a concave space that can accommodate castings. The steel shotis blasted from above, to realize the cleaning and polishing of parts.
Therefore, the rubber shot blasting machine crawlercame into being in the first production area of special tape in Qingdao, China. Compared with the steel belt, the rubber belt is of low product cost, simple assembly process and rapid replacement, but the more important advantage is that the rubber belt has high elasticity and almost no noise in the process of use, All kinds of soft metal parts rolling on the rubber track will not produce collision damage.
