Volunteers with special skills and financial donations to assist us in meeting the needs of the organizatin are welcome. However, The PD Avengers is NOT a registered charity and as such does not issue charitable tax receipts.
We welcome all Parkinson’s groups to partner with the PD Avengers. Please have them contact us at Larry@PDAvengers.com
Yes, you can be assured that we will never sell, rent, loan or share your information with anyone. We abide by industry standard guidelines at Constant Contact.
Each person’s PD history, comorbid illnesses, complications and medication history is unique. If you have any concerns about your health, please seek advice from your physician as soon as possible.
We are an independent group who hope to work with all Parkinson’s organizations who share our vision to end Parkinson’s disease. We believe that collaboration is key and that working in silos, duplication of efforts leads to a waste of resources and time.
The PD Avengers are a self-funded Parkinson’s advocacy coalition. The PD Avengers are not a registered charity.
