HELP TRAIN GOOGLE AI TO UNDERSTAND VOICES AFFECTED BY PARKINSON’S
New PD Avenger partner LSVT Global has partnered with Google AI for “Project Euphonia.” The project is helping to train automatic speech recognition software to better understand what people with Parkinson’s and other neurologically caused speech issues.
Hear the creators discuss Project Euphonia’s successes with ALS on theToday Show.Also,this introductionwill help you get acquainted with how the project works.
***The more impaired your speech is the better it is for the project as it helps challenge the AI. This project is open globally to readers of English, even if you have a strong accent on top of Parkinson’ s voice affects.
